# CHANGELOG hygiene

- `CHANGELOG.md` = Keep a Changelog for **users**, not agent run logs.
- Never append OpenClaw-reviewer ticks, `DIGEST_SHA256`, or repeated tester CLOSED↔TESTING paperwork.
- Exactly one `## [Unreleased]`. Archive noise to `docs/changelog-archive-agent-noise.md` if needed.
- Weekly owner: Monday ~10:00 schedule + skill `changelog-weekly-review` (`docs/040_changelog_hygiene.md`).
